From ed699bc2e0c95824a3043ed02b5221a9e748e276 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: juniorverli <25966843+juniorverli@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:07:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] dt-bindings: media: i2c: add OmniVision OV13858

Describe the OV13858 RAW10 image sensor for devicetree systems: the
19.2 MHz input clock, the dovdd, dvdd and avdd supplies, the active low
reset line and a four-lane D-PHY endpoint. The leds and led-names
properties used for a privacy LED come from video-interface-devices.yaml.

The sensor is already supported on ACPI systems; this schema only covers
the devicetree description. The reset GPIO is optional in the driver, but
a board that wires it should describe it.

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5
Assisted-by: Codex gpt-6.1-sol
---
